Photos allowed? Always ask before you shoot in Japan 📷
Rules change from room to room.

Today's phrases:
• しゃしんを とっても いいですか (shashin o tottemo ii desu ka) = May I take photos?
• フラッシュ (furasshu) = Flash
• だめです (dame desu) = Not allowed

